Document container updates with Diun

A "Container updates (Diun)" section in docs/configuration.md covers making
the token, the Diun webhook settings (with extra_hosts so a bridge-networked
Diun reaches pi-hub on the host), testing with diun notif test, matching
containers to services with the new container field, and dismissing. The
README lists the feature and the PIHUB_WEBHOOK_TOKEN and PIHUB_UPDATES
variables; the compose example, CONTRIBUTING layout and CHANGELOG follow.

Files: README.md, docs/configuration.md, compose.example.yml,
CONTRIBUTING.md, CHANGELOG.md
